3. NOT COVERED BY EITHER
===============================================================================

Data reproduced in the slides belongs to its source and is used for teaching:
Eurostat (balance of payments tables), the Banque de France / INSEE figures in
data/, and the FRED series fetched at build time (Board of Governors of the
Federal Reserve System; U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics, via FRED).

Any images you place in imgs/ keep whatever licence they came with — check
before making this repository public with photographs in it.
